      <title>Bitcoin Slips Below $80,000 After Kevin Warsh Inflation Vow</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-28/bitcoin-slips-below-80-000-after-kevin-warsh-inflation-vow</link>
